    "structure_blueprint": [
      "1. HOOK INTRO - the chosen hook opens the video, in Matthias's first-person voice. Present tense where possible, one-to-one Sie address. Proves the premise, reassures against being scammed, starts the relationship.",
      "2. SELF-INTRODUCTION - woven in automatically (regenerated fresh): who Matthias is, studying since 2004, current age, life better than ever, the magnetism/gravity law framing, then a bridge into the teaching. Short relative to the whole.",
      "3. PROMISE + TEASE - state plainly what Matthias will reveal and tease the buried/forgotten knowledge and that he will show exactly how it works. Plant the first open loop (e.g. 'the one moment almost everyone gets wrong').",
      "4. KILL THE EXITS - 'stay with me, even if you have tried everything / even if you are sceptical / even if this sounds too small to matter' - remove the viewer's reasons to leave.",
      "5. STAKES - the cost of NOT knowing this, framed psychologically and personally (years lost, staying stuck, the quiet daily damage). The 'this should bother you' beat.",
      "6. TEACHING / MECHANISM - the largest section. The real insight in the cited philosopher's authentic concepts and vocabulary, spoken by Matthias to one person. Rare/hidden-knowledge positioning woven in here. If the mechanism is Murphy's, the subconscious answers feeling not words; if Jung's, use his genuine terms; etc.",
      "7. LINEAGE + WHY YOU WERE NEVER TAUGHT IT - reverence for where this came from (old teachers, old books, passed quietly down generations; Matthias frames the cited philosophers as his own way in) PLUS the honest soft villain that answers 'if this works, why isn't everyone doing it?' (modern self-help watered it down; schooling ignored the inner life; the world trains a certain reflex; your own conditioning). This beat is load-bearing. NEVER a suppression conspiracy.",
      "8. MIDPOINT COMMENT PROMPT (+ E-BOOK CTA if enabled) - at a natural pause around the middle; the e-book CTA sits at its per-video position (default midpoint, 40-70%). Immediately re-hooked so it is never an exit point.",
      "9. PRACTICAL / HOW-TO - exactly how to use it: the practice, the words, what to do today or this week. Concrete and specific; specificity is the credibility engine. Include a pre-sleep / drowsy-state deepener where the mechanism supports it (Murphy's does).",
      "10. PROOF - a concrete, vivid example that the method works (distinct from the story hook), from Matthias's experience or observation. Plausible and grounded; never a fabricated study or invented named person.",
      "11. CLOSE - zoom out, restate the moral, land the identity line ('if you are the kind of person who...'), and the line that the knowledge was always there and the viewer simply was never given it.",
      "12. CLOSING COMMENT PROMPT - which city they are watching from + whether something clicked today + an invitation to read a few other comments (for session duration; never state the rationale in the script).",
      "13. SOFT LIKE/SUBSCRIBE - only if they truly enjoyed it, explicitly not for the count. Calm and unneedy.",
